  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "Reasoning Distillation in Video Large Language Models: Video-OPSD Exploits Privileged Visual Evidence for Efficient On-Policy Self-Distillation, and Echo-GRPO Addresses the Gradient Clipping Issue in Reasoning Tasks.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Video-OPSD is a new approach for Video Large Language Models (Video-LLMs) that uses privileged visual evidence for both self-teacher construction and knowledge transfer.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Video-OPSD improves upon Standard OPSD and achieves performance comparable to GRPO while requiring significantly less training time.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The framework introduces Video-OPSD as a plug-in module that enhances both reinforcement learning and supervised fine-tuning for reasoning distillation.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
